# API keys are NOT read from env at runtime — the app reads them from the user's
# secure device storage (Android Keystore / Web WebCrypto), entered in Settings.
# This file exists only to document the shape; DO NOT put real keys here or anywhere in the repo.
#
# DeepSeek (mainland-direct):     https://api.deepseek.com
# MiniMax  (mainland-direct):     https://api.minimaxi.com   (TTS: /v1/t2a_v2)
# OpenCode Zen (via proxy):       https://opencode.ai/zen/v1
#
# For local dev only, you MAY set these to exercise the provider layer from Node tests.
# They are gitignored via .env / .env.* — never commit a filled-in copy.
VITE_DEV_DEEPSEEK_KEY=
VITE_DEV_MINIMAX_KEY=
VITE_DEV_ZEN_KEY=
